<title>USA: Sweetwater UHSD, Calif. won by O'Connor &amp; Co..</title>
<headline>Sweetwater UHSD, Calif. won by O'Connor &amp; Co..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>O'Connor &amp; Co. said it won $5.185 million of Sweetwater UHSD, Calif., COP's (1997 capital improvements financing), with a true interest cost of 5.534 percent.</p>
</text>
